  "description": "Introducing Comic Bounce, a bold, chunky, and playful rounded display font created to bring energy and fun to every project. With its thick strokes, soft rounded edges, and cheerful comic-style letterforms, this cartoon font is perfect for designs that need to look friendly, eye-catching, and full of personality.\nWhether you are designing kids’ party invitations, children’s book titles, toy packaging, stickers, or social media posts, Comic Bounce gives your work an instant playful pop that grabs attention.",
